<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Cos Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Cos Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of United Cos Financial Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said in a report the company offers an attractive opportunity to participate in the higher-margin subprime mortgage lending industry.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 3/8 to 29.</p>
</text>
